From: Codex <codex@example.invalid>
Subject: thermal: qcom: tsens: increase temperature ready timeout

IPQ806x can report a transient -ETIMEDOUT from the first thermal zone
during early boot when the TSENS ready bit is not set within the current
100 us window. Increase the wait budget so early thermal checks do not
log a spurious Temperature check failed (-110) before the sensor has had
time to produce a sample.

--- a/drivers/thermal/qcom/tsens.h
+++ b/drivers/thermal/qcom/tsens.h
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
 #define CAL_DEGC_PT2		120
 #define SLOPE_FACTOR		1000
 #define SLOPE_DEFAULT		3200
-#define TIMEOUT_US		100
+#define TIMEOUT_US		10000
 #define THRESHOLD_MAX_ADC_CODE	0x3ff
 #define THRESHOLD_MIN_ADC_CODE	0x0
 
